#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:1
msgid "为什么需要量子采样"
msgstr "Why Quantum Sampling"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:3
msgid ""
"玻尔兹曼机的训练并不只取决于模型定义；从模型分布中获得足够好的样本同样关键。本章连接理论基础与后续实践，说明采样为何会成为瓶颈，以及 Kaiwu-"
"PyTorch-Plugin（KPP）如何让经典与相干伊辛机（CIM）采样器使用同一训练流程。"
msgstr "Training a Boltzmann machine depends not only on the model definition; obtaining sufficiently good samples from the model distribution is equally important. This chapter connects the theoretical foundations with subsequent practice, explaining why sampling becomes a bottleneck and how Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin (KPP) lets classical and coherent Ising machine (CIM) samplers use the same training workflow."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:5
msgid "精确最大似然学习中的采样问题"
msgstr "The Sampling Problem in Exact Maximum-Likelihood Learning"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:7
msgid "对于基于能量的模型，负对数似然梯度可分为数据分布与模型分布上的两项期望："
msgstr "For energy-based models, the negative log-likelihood gradient consists of expectations over the data distribution and the model distribution:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:9
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\theta} =\n"
"\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathrm{data}}\\left[\\frac{\\partial E_\\theta}{\\partial "
"\\theta}\\right] -\n"
"\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathrm{model}}\\left[\\frac{\\partial E_\\theta}{\\partial"
" \\theta}\\right].\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:15
msgid ""
"数据项可由 mini-batch 直接近似。模型项则要求从当前玻尔兹曼分布 $P_\\theta$ "
"采样；精确计算通常需要枚举指数数量的构型。因此，训练质量取决于样本是否足够接近目标分布，以及取得这些样本的成本。"
msgstr "The data term can be approximated directly with a mini-batch. The model term requires samples from the current Boltzmann distribution $P_\\theta$; exact computation generally requires enumerating an exponential number of configurations. Training quality therefore depends on both how closely samples match the target distribution and the cost of obtaining them."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:17
msgid "经典采样与近似训练"
msgstr "Classical Sampling and Approximate Training"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:19
msgid ""
"Gibbs 采样等 Markov Chain Monte "
"Carlo（MCMC）方法通过局部更新逐步接近目标分布。在能量景观存在多个模态和高能垒时，链可能长时间停留在局部区域，导致混合缓慢。"
msgstr "Markov Chain Monte Carlo (MCMC) methods such as Gibbs sampling approach the target distribution through local updates. When the energy landscape has multiple modes and high barriers, a chain may remain in a local region for a long time, resulting in slow mixing."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:21
msgid ""
"对比散度（CD）以少量 MCMC "
"步数换取训练速度，但得到的是近似梯度；持久对比散度（PCD）通过保留链状态改善这一近似，仍需为每次参数更新付出采样成本。它们是实用方法，但不应与平衡分布的精确采样混为一谈。"
msgstr "Contrastive divergence (CD) trades a small number of MCMC steps for training speed, but yields an approximate gradient. Persistent contrastive divergence (PCD) improves this approximation by retaining chain states, while still incurring sampling cost for every parameter update. They are practical methods, but should not be confused with exact sampling from the equilibrium distribution."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:23
msgid "从玻尔兹曼机到 Ising 哈密顿量"
msgstr "From Boltzmann Machines to the Ising Hamiltonian"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"二值变量 $x_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ 可通过 $s_i = 2x_i - 1$ 转换为 Ising 自旋 $s_i \\in "
"\\{-1, +1\\}$。相应的二次能量可写为："
msgstr "A binary variable $x_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ can be transformed into an Ising spin $s_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$ through $s_i = 2x_i - 1$. The corresponding quadratic energy can be written as:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"H(\\mathbf{s}) = -\\sum_i h_i s_i - \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij}s_i s_j + "
"\\mathrm{const}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:31
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其中 $h_i$ 与 $J_{ij}$ 分别表示局部场和耦合。KPP 会从模型参数构造 Ising 矩阵，并将其交给 Kaiwu SDK "
"优化器求解；用户无需手工完成变量转换。"
msgstr "Here, $h_i$ and $J_{ij}$ denote local fields and couplings, respectively. KPP constructs an Ising matrix from the model parameters and passes it to a Kaiwu SDK optimizer; users do not need to perform the variable transformation manually."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:33
msgid "KPP 中的经典与量子采样器"
msgstr "Classical and Quantum Samplers in KPP"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:35
msgid ""
"KPP 通过同一个 `sample(sampler)` 调用使用不同采样后端。`SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer` "
"适合本地调试和建立基线；`CIMOptimizer` 需要有效的 Kaiwu SDK "
"凭据及真机访问权限。两者的样本质量、延迟和成本应在相同模型、采样预算与评价指标下比较，不能仅由采样器类型推断优劣。"
msgstr "KPP uses different sampling backends through the same `sample(sampler)` call. `SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer` is suitable for local debugging and baselines; `CIMOptimizer` requires valid Kaiwu SDK credentials and access to real hardware. Sample quality, latency, and cost must be compared using the same model, sampling budget, and evaluation metrics rather than inferred solely from the sampler type."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:45
msgid "小结"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:47
msgid "玻尔兹曼机训练需要近似模型分布上的期望，采样成本是关键限制。"
msgstr "Boltzmann machine training requires approximating expectations over the model distribution, and sampling cost is a key limitation."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:48
msgid "MCMC、CD 与 PCD 在速度和近似误差之间取舍。"
msgstr "MCMC, CD, and PCD trade off speed against approximation error."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:49
msgid "KPP 将模型参数转换为 Ising 问题，并通过统一的采样接口连接经典与量子后端。"
msgstr "KPP converts model parameters into an Ising problem and connects classical and quantum backends through a unified sampling interface."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md:50
msgid "是否使用真机采样应由可用硬件、端到端延迟、样本质量和实验目标共同决定。"
msgstr "Whether to use real-hardware sampling should be determined jointly by available hardware, end-to-end latency, sample quality, and experimental goals."

